# Dormant Powers Dislodged (jeuno 136), the draw's range: a level 86 Warrior with the Limit Breaker at cap 90, the three
# earlier limit breaks completed, available. Forty draws in a row: before each, itemWanted 0 (a GM: index -1, below 0),
# then the trigger draws math.randomInt(0, 9) from the seeded RNG's next numbers and sends the index, 10045 (86, 1, 4,
# 0, 0, drawn; the last param is trimmed when it is 0); itemWanted is set to the index + 1. The draws are
# 2, 1, 4, 5, 9, 4, 7, 7, 9, 6, 3, 2, 7, 4, 2, 0, 5, 5, 8, 9, 7, 9, 7, 3, 6, 8, 0, 8, 5, 0, 2, 7, 3, 2, 0, 4, 1, 0, 9, 1:
# index 0 (draws 16, 27, 30, 35, 38) and index 9 (draws 5, 9, 20, 22, 39) both occur, so a range that starts at 1 or
# stops at 8 differs. Above: on this stream randomInt(0, 10), (0, 11) and (0, 12) first differ from these draws at
# draws 25, 13 and 10 (a draw of 10 and more would be raw 10 or more), so a range wider than 0-9 differs as well.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=86
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 90
quest Jeuno.NewWorldsAwait completed
quest Jeuno.ExpandingHorizons completed
quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
login
charvar Quest[3][136]itemWanted 0      # a GM
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # draw 1: 10045 (86, 1, 4, 0, 0, 2)
finish option=0
